      value: 'Filter: This object is used to clean the water coming from the tank.
        It filters out impurities and allows only clean water to pass through for
        safe use. While it doesn''t show a visual transformation, it represents the
        process of purification in the rainwater harvesting system. The filter ensures
        that only safe, usable water reaches the tap.'
